  "description": "The Eight Rules of the Lower Class:\n1. A lower class must be cunning.\n2. A lower class must be quick-witted.\n3. A lower class must never get angry.\n4. A lower class must never draw a sword recklessly.\n5. A lower class must not cause trouble.\n6. A lower class must stay away from beautiful women.\n7. A lower class must never associate with lower class people.\n8. A lower class must know their place.\n\nI realized long ago that if I kept to these Eight Rules of the Lower Class, I could act as a master.\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
